  "description": "Meet the Eskute V100 Pro Electric Bike — bold moped style, upgraded power, and long-range performance.\nWith rugged 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires, dual suspension with front fork and rear shock absorption, and a powerful 1500W peak motor delivering speeds up to 30 MPH, the V100 Pro is built for confident rides across city streets, gravel paths, snow, and rough terrain.\n\nPowered by a 48V 15.6Ah removable battery, with up to 65 miles of range, plus a 7-speed gear system, twist throttle, and pedal assist, the V100 Pro gives riders flexible control for daily commuting, cruising, and weekend exploration.\n\nComplete with a clear multifunction display, upgraded front and rear lights, front and rear fenders, and an extended comfort saddle, the V100 Pro combines power, comfort, and standout electric dirt bike-inspired styling.\n\nBuilt for riders who want stronger performance, all-terrain capability, and more freedom to go farther.",
